# WorldVision Summons: Codex Page Finalizer

The generator is the mutable workshop. A finalized Codex Page is an immutable, deterministic, print-ready artifact: A4 portrait, illuminated manuscript / equipment plate.

Do not write the sealed page back into `UiSheetData`. Do not call `Date.now()` inside normalize, compose, hash, or export. The caller supplies `finalizedAt`. The content hash is SHA-256 of canonical JSON with sorted keys, excluding `contentHash`.

