## Plate

| Region | Component | Content |
|---|---|---|
| A | CodexTitleCartouche | Name, epithet, title, motto |
| B | CodexIdentityRail | Role, crest, marks, top 6 traits |
| C | CodexPortraitStage | Fixed crop, alpha matte, leader anchors |
| D | CodexGearRail | 6 gear callouts |
| E F G | CodexBottomSystem | Vitals, attributes, chronicle |
| H | CodexFooterProvenance | Revision, template, hash, timestamp |

The normative spec is `codex.mdc`. Palette: Ink `#211813`, Oxblood `#6B3324`, Gilded Bronze `#B37B3D`, Aged Fiber `#DBC69F`, Parchment `#F2E7CF`. Frame weights 0.4pt and 1.2pt. Page 210mm × 297mm. PNG profile 2480×3508. PDF page size 210mm × 297mm. US Letter is a second output profile, not a second composition. `schemaVersion` is `"codex.snapshot.v1"`. The content hash is `provenance.sourceHash`.

Mount with `CodexFinalizer` from `src/features/codex`, passing the live `UiSheetData` workshop object. Locking copies fields into `CodexSnapshotV1` and freezes them.
